  {
    "name": "get_product_offers",
    "title": "Product offers",
    "description": "Get paginated shop offers for a product (5 per page).\n\nWHEN TO USE:\n- User asks \"more shops\", \"all sellers\", \"where can I buy\", \"cheapest with shipping\"\n- User asks about payment methods, delivery options, return policies across sellers\n- get_product_details only shows 3 preview offers — use this for the full list\n\nRETURNS per offer:\n- shop: name, logo, merchant info, ratings\n- pricing: price, base price (per unit), shipping cost\n- delivery: status, dates, free-shipping flag\n- payment: accepted methods\n- meta: return policy days, offer freshness\n- nextOffset: feed into next call; 0 means no more pages\n\nPAGINATION LOOP:\n1. First call: omit offset (defaults to 0).\n2. Read nextOffset from response.\n3. If nextOffset > 0, call again with offset=nextOffset.\n4. Stop when nextOffset === 0.\n\nINPUT: productRef + optional offset + optional country (DE default) + optional type.\nOUTPUT: up to 5 offers + nextOffset.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "productRef": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "description": "Opaque `productRef` from search_products or get_product_details."
        },
        "country": {
          "description": "Marketplace: DE (Germany), AT (Austria), GB or UK (United Kingdom), FR (France), IT (Italy), ES (Spain). An omitted or unknown code uses Germany.",
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 2,
          "maxLength": 2
        },
        "type": {
          "description": "Catalog item shape from search. Omit unless non-PRODUCT.",
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "CLUSTER",
            "PRODUCT",
            "SINGLE_OFFER"
          ]
        },
        "offset": {
          "description": "Page cursor. Omit on the first page; pass `nextOffset` from the previous offers response for later pages.",
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "productRef"
      ]
    },
    "execution": null,
    "output_schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "type": "object",
